From cbf5f8110a55df78a70d448b5a6baea4e4a30776 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 00:24:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Audit fix c: registry names, card-line clubs and league hub
 text

player_registry.json: the three rows named by their raw id take their
careers-file names (simiewa01 Wayne Simien, walshma01 Matt Walsh,
fitchge01 Gerald Fitch), each with a dated name_corrected note; their
closed results still match by id and their stat lines are unchanged. The
eight rows of clubs the 2003 baselines lack get their code (CHA, NOK).

card_lines.json (2003-04, 2004-05): each regular row's Team(s) cell is
rewritten from the season's closed results (league_cards
.repair_card_lines: the clubs of his appearances, in stint order); every
other cell is as written at the close.

League/README.md: the hand-maintained text no longer says unregistered
players are never added or that the club column is a source label; the
navigation and counts are generated (season_pages.hub).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ExmaEeFA7X8K2pJG6n4PLH
